# bootstrap.build.packages — the toolchain install-texlive.sh needs
#
# Installed in the Docker `base` stage, so nothing here is installed into the
# final image. `README.md` in the directory above owns the row format and the
# classes.

gnupg       verifies the TeX Live repository signature
gzip        unpacks the installer archive
perl        install-tl and tlmgr are Perl programs
tar         unpacks the installer archive
wget        fetches the installer and the packages
xzdec       decompresses the package archives
